# Integer128 subtraction in both operand orders

Subtracts 123456789 from the int128 maximum in both operand orders to
verify the difference keeps its magnitude with the sign following the
operand order.

>>> source
left: int128 = 170141183460469231731687303715884105727
right: int128 = 123456789

// Verifies subtraction with the larger operand first.
forward_diff: int128 = left - right
print(forward_diff)

// Verifies subtraction with the smaller operand first.
reversed_diff: int128 = right - left
print(reversed_diff)

<<< stdout
170141183460469231731687303715760648938
-170141183460469231731687303715760648938

<<< stderr
